# Fixture affix file for spell_kit tests: the suggester's REP, one-edit and NOSUGGEST tiers. The
# MAP tier is instead exercised against the real French dictionary (see spell_suggester_test.dart),
# since the plan's own example ("sequence" -> "séquence") is about that dictionary's own table.
SET UTF-8
TRY acefhlnopst

REP 1
REP ph f

NOSUGGEST !
